{
  "id": "vitrinecertaset01",
  "name": "VC 0 · Setup (planilha + pastas do Drive)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Rode uma vez só\n\nClique em **Execute workflow**. Ele:\n\n1. Baixa o `calendario.csv` do repositório.\n2. Cria a planilha **Vitrine Certa — Calendário** com as abas `Calendario` e `Atendimento`.\n3. Grava as 112 linhas (28 posts de feed e 84 stories).\n4. Cria no Drive a pasta **Vitrine Certa** com `MIDIA`, `1-ENTRADA` e `NARRACAO`.\n5. O último nó imprime todos os ids que os outros fluxos precisam.\n\nRodar duas vezes cria tudo de novo, duplicado. Se precisar refazer, apague antes o que ficou.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "nota-0",
      "name": "LEIA-ME",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-900, -260]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "trig",
      "name": "Começar",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-700, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArthurBSC/vitrine-certa/main/automacao/n8n/calendario.csv",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "text",
              "outputPropertyName": "csv"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "baixar",
      "name": "Baixar o calendário",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [-480, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "let texto = $input.first().json.csv || '';\nif (texto.charCodeAt(0) === 0xfeff) texto = texto.slice(1);\n\nfunction lerCsv(s) {\n  const linhas = [];\n  let campo = '';\n  let linha = [];\n  let dentro = false;\n  for (let i = 0; i < s.length; i++) {\n    const c = s[i];\n    if (dentro) {\n      if (c === '\"') {\n        if (s[i + 1] === '\"') { campo += '\"'; i++; }\n        else dentro = false;\n      } else campo += c;\n    } else {\n      if (c === '\"') dentro = true;\n      else if (c === ',') { linha.push(campo); campo = ''; }\n      else if (c === '\\r') { /* ignora */ }\n      else if (c === '\\n') { linha.push(campo); linhas.push(linha); linha = []; campo = ''; }\n      else campo += c;\n    }\n  }\n  if (campo !== '' || linha.length) { linha.push(campo); linhas.push(linha); }\n  return linhas;\n}\n\nconst values = lerCsv(texto).filter(l => l.length > 1);\nif (values.length < 100) throw new Error('CSV veio incompleto: ' + values.length + ' linhas');\n\nreturn [{ json: { values, total: values.length - 1 } }];"
      },
      "id": "converter",
      "name": "Converter CSV",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-260, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://sheets.googleapis.com/v4/spreadsheets",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "googleSheetsOAuth2Api",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ properties: { title: 'Vitrine Certa — Calendário', locale: 'pt_BR', timeZone: 'America/Sao_Paulo' }, sheets: [ { properties: { title: 'Calendario' } }, { properties: { title: 'Atendimento' } } ] }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "criar-planilha",
      "name": "Criar a planilha",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [-40, 100],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "v8ZDI5IbrP0WTKhJ",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://sheets.googleapis.com/v4/spreadsheets/{{ $json.spreadsheetId }}/values/Calendario:append",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "googleSheetsOAuth2Api",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "specifyQuery": "json",
        "jsonQuery": "={{ JSON.stringify({ valueInputOption: 'RAW', insertDataOption: 'INSERT_ROWS' }) }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ values: $('Converter CSV').first().json.values }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "gravar-cal",
      "name": "Gravar o calendário",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [180, 100],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "v8ZDI5IbrP0WTKhJ",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://sheets.googleapis.com/v4/spreadsheets/{{ $('Criar a planilha').first().json.spreadsheetId }}/values/Atendimento:append",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "googleSheetsOAuth2Api",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "specifyQuery": "json",
        "jsonQuery": "={{ JSON.stringify({ valueInputOption: 'RAW', insertDataOption: 'INSERT_ROWS' }) }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ values: [['quando','tipo','autor','mensagem','resposta']] }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "gravar-atd",
      "name": "Cabeçalho do atendimento",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [400, 100],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "v8ZDI5IbrP0WTKhJ",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://www.googleapis.com/drive/v3/files",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "googleDriveOAuth2Api",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ name: 'Vitrine Certa', mimeType: 'application/vnd.google-apps.folder' }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "pasta-mae",
      "name": "Criar a pasta Vitrine Certa",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [620, 100],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "xFJCYtZgTdKgFVLR",
          "name": "Google Drive account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const pai = $input.first().json.id;\nreturn ['MIDIA', '1-ENTRADA', 'NARRACAO'].map(nome => ({ json: { nome, pai } }));"
      },
      "id": "lista-sub",
      "name": "Listar subpastas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [840, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://www.googleapis.com/drive/v3/files",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "googleDriveOAuth2Api",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ name: $json.nome, mimeType: 'application/vnd.google-apps.folder', parents: [$json.pai] }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "criar-sub",
      "name": "Criar as subpastas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1060, 100],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "xFJCYtZgTdKgFVLR",
          "name": "Google Drive account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const planilha = $('Criar a planilha').first().json;\nconst pastaMae = $('Criar a pasta Vitrine Certa').first().json;\nconst subs = {};\nfor (const item of $input.all()) subs[item.json.name] = item.json.id;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    PLANILHA_ID: planilha.spreadsheetId,\n    PLANILHA_URL: planilha.spreadsheetUrl,\n    linhas_gravadas: $('Converter CSV').first().json.total,\n    PASTA_VITRINE: pastaMae.id,\n    PASTA_MIDIA: subs['MIDIA'],\n    PASTA_ENTRADA: subs['1-ENTRADA'],\n    PASTA_NARRACAO: subs['NARRACAO'],\n    proximo_passo: 'Suba os 130 arquivos de midia/drive na pasta MIDIA e preencha estes ids nos fluxos 1 e 3.'\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "resumo",
      "name": "Resumo com os ids",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1280, 100]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
